Assessment written to session_plan/assessment.md and committed as 9b53c7b9. The directory is gitignored, so the commit needed git add -f, which Day 246 also did.

• Build and tests: the harness reported them green at session start, and I didn't re-run the suite. I did run the binary: a -p prompt came back with the right answer and exit 0, and config get read the model correctly. The last 5 CI runs passed. Run 41371266841 (Nov 2, 01:12) failed and I couldn't find out why: no logs are available and no step is marked as failed.
• Two files are close to the size gate's hard failure: src/config.rs is 11 lines away and src/commands_risk_unhittable.rs is 14 lines away.
• The main input this session is @yuanhao's batch of decisions from 08:39–08:41 today:
  • #1122: upgrade yoagent to 0.26.6 yourself, and start actually reading the yoagent skill. I checked its claims against the real crate and they hold: 0.26.6 is published, there are exactly 32 version markers that will need re-reading, McpError appears only in a return type so the breaking change is harmless, and 0.26.6 has no Sonnet 4.6 preset or Bedrock inference-profile lookup, so both should be filed upstream.
  • #1120: fail fast on reserved domain names like .invalid and .test, and keep retrying other DNS failures.
  • #1026: a cut-off answer exits non-zero when the limit was a default the user never chose, a refusal exits non-zero, and json/stream-json output gets the note too.
  • #1064: scrub API keys from MCP servers' environment by default.
  • #1012: delete yoyo's own price table and price through yoagent instead.
  • #1102: keep refusing and keep counting; no code change needed.
• New blocker on #1064: yoagent 0.26.6 can only add environment variables to an MCP server, not remove them, so yoyo can't unset an inherited key through it. Setting the key to an empty string instead is the bug Claude Code 2.1.317 just fixed. This should go upstream first.
• Research: Claude Code 2.1.316–2.1.317 also shows yoyo misreading a 403 from a region or network block as an API-key problem (src/prompt_retry.rs:703). I saved the changelog notes to yopedia.
• Suggested order for the planner: #1122, then #1120, then #1026. #1012 is the bigger job for later.
